{"articleNo":"56029","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=56029&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012년 1학기 강의평가 참여기간 연장 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.05.30","hit":"7286","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2012학년도 1학기 강의평가 연장실시 안내</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2012학년도 1학기 강의평가 연장시행 일정을 아래와 같이 안내하오니&nbsp;<br>전 학생은 빠짐없이 본인이 수강한 과목에 대하여&nbsp;<br>강의평가에 참여하여 성실하게 설문에 응하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">1. 강의평가의 목적</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp; ◈ 수강한 과목에 대한 이해정도와 강의에 대한 의견 수렴</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;◈ 평가 결과를 바탕으로 한 강의의 개선방안 연구 등 다음 학기의</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;교육 효율성 향상 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2. 대상 강좌</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp; 2012학년도 1학기에 개설된 모든 강좌</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp; ☞ 평가제외 : 군사학, 현장실습, 교직실습, 사회봉사 과목</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">3. 평가자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> : 강좌별 수강학생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">4. 평가 기간(당초)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2012.05.21(월) 09:00 ~ 2012.06.03(일) 23:59</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium non